sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant O as OPA
  participant S as MCP server
  A->>G: tools/call mail.list_inbox, agent token
  G->>G: check iss, aud, exp, scope, agent_id
  G->>S: tools/list with a downstream token
  S-->>G: catalogue
  G->>G: compare SHA-256 with the pin
  G->>O: input document
  O-->>G: allow
  G->>S: tools/call with a new downstream token
  S-->>G: inbox
  G-->>A: allow, plus the decision trace
